#. type: Yaml Front Matter Hash Value: title
#: src/en/documentation/use/guides/two-factor-auth.md:1
#, no-wrap
msgid "Two-Factor Authentication"
msgstr "Двофакторска аутентификација"

#. type: Plain text
#: src/en/documentation/use/guides/two-factor-auth.md:14
msgid ""
"Two-factor authentication (2FA) enhances the security of your Zammad account "
"by adding an extra layer of verification beyond a password. It requires you "
"to provide two different types of authentication factors, typically "
"something you know (like a password) and something you possess (like a "
"mobile device or a security token), to ensure that you are an authorized "
"individual who can access the account."
msgstr ""
"Двофакторска аутентификација (2FA) повишава безбедност вашег Zammad налога "
"додавањем додатног слоја верификације поред лозинке. Захтева од вас да "
"обезбедите два различита фактора за аутентификацију, обично нешто што знате "
"(попут лозинке) и нешто што поседујете (као што је мобилни уређај или "
"безбедносни кључ), да би потвдили да сте овлашћена особа која може да "
"приступи налогу."

#. type: Plain text
#: src/en/documentation/use/guides/two-factor-auth.md:19
msgid ""
"Two-Factor Authentication is an **optional feature**. Administrators must "
"activate it to be visible in your profile settings. It may be even enforced "
"by your admin to set up a 2FA method. In this case, you can't use Zammad "
"unless you set up at least one 2FA method."
msgstr ""

#. type: Title ##
#: src/en/documentation/use/guides/two-factor-auth.md:20
#, no-wrap
msgid "Set Up"
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: src/en/documentation/use/guides/two-factor-auth.md:26
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"If the system admin has enabled this feature, you can head to *Avatar >\n"
"Profile > Two-factor Authentication* to set it up. Depending on the\n"
"enabled two-factor methods, you may see one or more options in the\n"
"table.\n"
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: src/en/documentation/use/guides/two-factor-auth.md:28
msgid ""
"To set up a two-factor method, use the wrench icon and follow the steps."
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: src/en/documentation/use/guides/two-factor-auth.md:30
