#. type: Title ##
#: src/en/documentation/use/guides/two-factor-auth.md:119
#, no-wrap
msgid "Sign-in"
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: src/en/documentation/use/guides/two-factor-auth.md:125
msgid ""
"When you set up two-factor authentication for your Zammad account, during "
"the next sign-in you will be asked to provide the same two-factor method "
"after entering correct username and password. Depending on the chosen two-"
"factor method, this may be a security code, hardware key, etc."
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: src/en/documentation/use/guides/two-factor-auth.md:129
msgid ""
"In case you are having issues during sign-in with your preferred two-factor "
"authentication method, you can switch to another one, provided you have set "
"it up previously."
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: src/en/documentation/use/guides/two-factor-auth.md:133
msgid ""
"Look for **Try another method** link below the sign in box. In case you "
"don't see this link, you probably have no other available two-factor methods "
"set up, or your admin has disabled this feature."
msgstr ""
"Потражите линк **Покушајте други метод** испод прозора за пријаву. У случају "
"да не видите овај линк, вероватно немате подешене друге доступне методе "
"двофакторске аутентификације или је ваш администратор онемогућио ову "
"функцију."

#. type: Plain text
#: src/en/documentation/use/guides/two-factor-auth.md:135
msgid ""
"![Log in screen with link to \"Try another method\"](/screenshots/two-factor-"
"auth-usage/2fa-link-another-method.png)"
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: src/en/documentation/use/guides/two-factor-auth.md:140
msgid ""
"Alternatively, you can also use one of your recovery codes, which are auto-"
"generated for your account during the initial setup of the two-factor "
"authentication. Click on **Or use one of your recovery codes**, enter one of "
"your unused codes and click on **Sign in**."
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: src/en/documentation/use/guides/two-factor-auth.md:142
msgid ""
"![Log in screen with recovery codes link](/screenshots/two-factor-auth-"
"usage/2fa-login-recovery-codes.png)"
msgstr ""

#. type: Fenced div block (warning)
#: src/en/documentation/use/guides/two-factor-auth.md:143
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"You can use a single recovery code only once! In case you exhaust the\n"
"list of your recovery codes, it is recommended you regenerate them for\n"
"your account.\n"
msgstr ""

