#. type: Title #
#: src/en/get-started/installation/docker.md:6
#, no-wrap
msgid "Install with Docker"
msgstr "Docker инсталација"

#. type: Plain text
#: src/en/get-started/installation/docker.md:10
#, fuzzy
#| msgid ""
#| "Zammad can be deployed using Docker-Compose. You can even use graphical "
#| "docker front ends like [Portainer](https://www.portainer.io/)."
msgid ""
"Zammad can be deployed using Docker-Compose. You can even use graphical "
"docker front ends like [Portainer](https://www.portainer.io/){target=_blank}."
msgstr ""
"Zammad се може покренути преко Docker Compose. Можете чак користити и "
"графички интерфејс за Docker као што је [Portainer](https://www.portainer."
"io/)."

#. type: Fenced div block (info)
#: src/en/get-started/installation/docker.md:11
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"\n"
"We do not provide support in terms of Docker (-Compose) or Portainer specific\n"
"problems. If you choose to run Zammad via Docker, support is only provided for\n"
"the Zammad application.\n"
msgstr ""
