#. type: Title #
#: src/en/reference/config-db-server.md:1
#: src/en/reference/config-db-server.md:6
#, fuzzy, no-wrap
#| msgid "Database Server"
msgid "Configure Database Server"
msgstr "Сервис базе података"

#. type: Plain text
#: src/en/reference/config-db-server.md:11
msgid ""
"This page should only enlighten the relevant parts for Zammad and is not "
"meant to be a complete guide. It is only relevant for you if you are running "
"an existing PostgreSQL server and want to run Zammad's database there as "
"well."
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: src/en/reference/config-db-server.md:22
msgid ""
"Below you can the locations of the relevant PostgreSQL configuration files "
"to adjust. Keep in mind that versions may differ from your setup - adapt "
"where needed."
msgstr ""

#. type: Fenced div block (tabs)
#: src/en/reference/config-db-server.md:23
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"\n"
"=== Debian & Ubuntu\n"
"\n"
"```sh\n"
"/etc/postgresql/{your version}/main/postgresql.conf\n"
"```\n"
"\n"
"=== CentOS & OpenSUSE\n"
"\n"
"```\n"
"/var/lib/pgsql/data/postgresql.conf\n"
"```\n"
"\n"
"=== Others\n"
"\n"
"Can't find your configuration files? You can run the following command\n"
"to get the path:\n"
"\n"
"``` sh\n"
"$ sudo -u postgres psql -c 'SHOW config_file'\n"
"```\n"
msgstr ""

#. type: Title ##
#: src/en/reference/config-db-server.md:47
#, no-wrap
msgid "Adjust Pool Size"
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: src/en/reference/config-db-server.md:52
msgid ""
"Within `database.yml` (`config/` directory) you can define the allowed pool "
"size. By default each Zammad process takes up to `50` connections (`pool: "
"50`)."
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: src/en/reference/config-db-server.md:56
msgid ""
"This should be fairly enough for *every* use case. If you experience "
"database connection timeouts or similar pool errors, this usually indicates "
"to other issues that are relevant to your PostgreSQL."
msgstr ""

#. type: Title ##
#: src/en/reference/config-db-server.md:58
#, no-wrap
msgid "Adjust `max_connections` (mandatory)"
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: src/en/reference/config-db-server.md:61
msgid ""
"Zammad will take up to 200 connections by default, with below command you "
"can raise this limit fairly high."
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: src/en/reference/config-db-server.md:63
msgid "Raise maximum allowed number of connections:"
msgstr ""

#. type: Fenced code block (sh)
#: src/en/reference/config-db-server.md:63
#, no-wrap
msgid "sed -i \"/max_connections/c\\max_connections = 2000\" <postgresql-configuration-file>\n"
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: src/en/reference/config-db-server.md:67
#: src/en/reference/config-db-server.md:94
msgid "Apply changes by restarting postgresql and Zammad (in this order):"
msgstr ""

#. type: Fenced code block (sh)
#: src/en/reference/config-db-server.md:67
#: src/en/reference/config-db-server.md:94
#, no-wrap
msgid "systemctl restart postgresql zammad\n"
msgstr "systemctl restart postgresql zammad\n"

#. type: Title ##
#: src/en/reference/config-db-server.md:71
#, no-wrap
msgid "Adjust PostgreSQL for bigger instances (optional)"
msgstr ""

#. type: Fenced div block (warning)
#: src/en/reference/config-db-server.md:73
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"Check below settings first and ensure your system is able to provide\n"
"the requirements! Below settings are what we found to be useful,\n"
"everything else is out of scope of this documentation!\n"
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: src/en/reference/config-db-server.md:80
msgid "Some caching improvements:"
msgstr ""

#. type: Fenced code block (sh)
#: src/en/reference/config-db-server.md:80
#, no-wrap
msgid "sed -i \"/shared_buffers/c\\shared_buffers = 2GB\" <postgresql-configuration-file>\n"
msgstr ""

#. type: Fenced code block (sh)
#: src/en/reference/config-db-server.md:83
#, no-wrap
msgid "sed -i \"/temp_buffers/c\\temp_buffers = 256MB\" <postgresql-configuration-file>\n"
msgstr ""

#. type: Fenced code block (sh)
#: src/en/reference/config-db-server.md:86
#, no-wrap
msgid "sed -i \"/work_mem/c\\work_mem = 10MB\" <postgresql-configuration-file>\n"
msgstr ""

#. type: Fenced code block (sh)
#: src/en/reference/config-db-server.md:89
#, no-wrap
msgid "sed -i \"/max_stack_depth/c\\max_stack_depth = 5MB\" <postgresql-configuration-file>\n"
msgstr ""

