#. type: Title ##
#: src/en/reference/rest-api/cti.md:359
#, no-wrap
msgid "Call Hangup"
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: src/en/reference/rest-api/cti.md:365
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"`event` <Badge type=\"info\" text=\"hangup\" />:\n"
": Tell Zammad that someone answered the call.\n"
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: src/en/reference/rest-api/cti.md:390
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"`cause`\n"
": This defines the reason of the hangup. Zammad evaluates the cause and\n"
"  indicates e.g. missed calls accordingly in the caller log.\n"
"  Possible values are:\n"
"  - `normalClearing` (one of the parties hung up after the call was established)\n"
"  - `busy` (the called party was busy)\n"
"  - `cancel` (the caller hung up before the called party picked up)\n"
"  - `noAnswer` (the called party rejected the call. E.g. through a DND setting)\n"
"  - `congestion` (the called party could not be reached)\n"
"  - `notFound` (the called number does not exist or called party is offline)\n"
"  - `forwarded` (the call was forwarded to a different party)\n"
msgstr ""

