#. type: Title ####
#: src/en/tutorials/webserver-config.md:228
#, no-wrap
msgid "Step 5 - Enable the Site"
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: src/en/tutorials/webserver-config.md:232
msgid ""
"This step mostly depends on your selected folders and should only affect "
"``sites-available`` folders."
msgstr ""

#. type: Fenced div block (tabs)
#: src/en/tutorials/webserver-config.md:233
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"\n"
"=== Ubuntu, Debian, OpenSUSE\n"
"\n"
"Make sure the following line is present in your Apache config\n"
"(``/etc/apache2/apache2.conf``):\n"
"```\n"
"IncludeOptional sites-enabled/*.conf\n"
"```\n"
"\n"
"Enable it:\n"
"```sh\n"
"a2ensite zammad\n"
"```\n"
"\n"
"=== CentOS\n"
"\n"
"Make sure the following line is present in your Apache config\n"
"(``/etc/httpd/conf/httpd.conf``):\n"
"```\n"
"IncludeOptional sites-enabled/*.conf\n"
"```\n"
"\n"
"Enable it:\n"
"```sh\n"
"ln -s /etc/httpd/sites-available/zammad_ssl.conf /etc/httpd/sites-enabled/\n"
"```\n"
"\n"
msgstr ""

#. type: Title ####
#: src/en/tutorials/webserver-config.md:263
#, no-wrap
msgid "Step 6 - Save & Reload"
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: src/en/tutorials/webserver-config.md:267
msgid ""
